        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0012515</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Hip flexion is mediated by multiple muscles including the iliopsoas, the rectus femoris, the sartorius, and several muscles from the medial compartment of thigh.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Hip flexor weakness</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
